#. ~ Use action holster_msg for {'str': 'MBR vest (Kevlar plates)', 'str_pl':
#. 'MBR vests (Kevlar plates)'}.
#. ~ Use action holster_msg for {'str': 'MBR vest (steel plating)', 'str_pl':
