#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A weapon used for fencing, the most noble of all sports.  Unfortunately, a "
"fencing foil is rather useless as a weapon, due to its flexible shaft and "
"dull tip."
msgstr ""
"Un arma utilizada en el esgrima, el más noble de todos los deportes. "
"Lamentablemente, un florete de esgrima es bastante inútil como arma, debido "
"a su hoja flexible y punta sin filo."

