"la caballería de la Era Moderna y períodos siguientes."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "rapier"
msgid_plural "rapiers"
msgstr[0] "florete"
msgstr[1] "floretes"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rapier'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a blunted, cheap replica of a thin sword with an ornate hand guard."
"  It looks like the preferred weapon of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light "
"and quick, it makes any battle a stylish battle."
msgstr ""
"Es una réplica berreta sin filo de una espada fina con la guarda decorada. "
"Es como la que usaría un caballero o un espadachín. Ligera y rápida, hace "
"que cualquier batalla sea con estilo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "wakizashi"
msgid_plural "wakizashi"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'wakizashi'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a dull, cheap replica of the more common wakizashi.  Smaller and "
"lighter than a katana, but still effective in combat."
msgstr ""
"Es una réplica berreta sin filo de un wakizashi común. Más chica y liviana "
"que una katana, pero aún así eficaz en el combate."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "kris"
msgid_plural "krises"
msgstr[0] "kris"
msgstr[1] "krises"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'kris', 'str_pl': 'krises'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a dull, cheap replica of a wavy bladed dagger that comes from "
"Southeast Asia."
msgstr ""
"Es una réplica berreta sin filo de una daga de hoja asimétrica, originaria "
"del sureste asiático."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "lajatang"
msgid_plural "lajatangs"
msgstr[0] "lajatang"
msgstr[1] "lajatang"

