"This is a large towel, covered in a thick, gooey liquid.  You'll need to "
"wash it in some water to make it usable again.  Don't panic."
msgstr ""
"Es una toalla grande, cubierta con un líquido pegajoso y espeso. Vas a tener"
" que lavarla con agua para poder usarla. No te desesperes."

