#. ~ Description for garden gnome
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A normal and completely harmless garden gnome.  You can place him in your "
"garden or elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Es un gnomo de jardín totalmente normal e indefenso. Podés ponerlo en tu "
"jardín o en cualquier lado."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
