"normal. Pudiste quedarte con tu cámara, con un poco de suerte vas a sacar "
"unas fotos fantásticas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Gym Teacher"
msgstr "Profesor de Gimnasia"

#. ~ Profession (male Gym Teacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After a career of teaching kids the art of sports they mostly hate, the "
"zombies around you refuse to do laps, even at the blow of your whistle."
msgstr ""
"Luego de una vida enseñándole a los chicos el arte de los deportes que "
"siempre odiaron, los zombis a tu alrededor se niegan a hacer flexiones de "
"brazos, incluso aunque toques tu silbato."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Gym Teacher"
msgstr "Profesora de Gimnasia"

#. ~ Profession (female Gym Teacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
