msgid "Vatgrown Bodyguard"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (male Vatgrown Bodyguard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Grown in some corporate laboratory to provide the perfect bodyguard, with "
"nothing to live for but your client.  The Cataclysm ignored social strata "
"and somehow you outlived your master.  Now no one knows the conditioning "
"words to force your obedience.  While the world burns, you get your first "
"taste of life."
msgstr ""

