"Ha estado equivocado en cada una de las cosas que hizo, incluyendo estas "
"misma."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I have an infinite capacity for knowledge, and even I'm not sure what's "
"going on outside."
msgstr ""
"Tengo una infinita capacidad de conocimiento, e incluso yo no puedo estar "
"seguro de lo que sucede afuera."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Stop squirming and die like an adult or I'm going to delete your backup."
msgstr ""
"Deje de intentar escaparse y muera como un adulto normal, o voy a borrar su "
"copia de seguridad."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Good job on that, by the way.  SARCASM SPHERE SELF-TEST COMPLETE."
msgstr ""
"Buen trabajo con eso, la verdad. AUTO-PRUEBA DE ÁMBITO DE SARCASMO "
"COMPLETADA."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I don't want to tell you your business, but if it were me, I'd leave that "
"thing alone."
msgstr ""
"No le quiero decir lo que tiene que hacer, pero si fuera yo, no me metería "
"con esa cosa."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Let's be honest: Neither one of us knows what that thing does.  Just put it "
"in the corner, and I'll deal with it later."
msgstr ""
"Vamos a ser honestos: ninguno de los dos sabemos qué hace esa cosa. Déjele "
"en el rincón, y yo me ocuparé más tarde."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I know you don't believe this, but everything that has happened so far was "
"for your benefit."
msgstr ""
"Sé que no me cree, pero todo lo que sucedió hasta ahora fue en su propio "
"beneficio."

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I'm checking some blueprints, and I think…  Yes, right here.  You're "
"definitely going the wrong way."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "Are you even listening to me?"
msgstr "¿Me está escuchando?"

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I've got a feeling we're not in Kansas anymore.\""
msgstr "\"Tengo la sensación de que ya no estamos en Kansas.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Go ahead, make my day.\""
msgstr "\"Dale, haceme el día.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You talkin' to me?\""
msgstr "\"¿Me estás hablando a mí?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Then who the hell else are you talkin' to?\""
msgstr "\"¿Entonces a quién carajo le estás hablando?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Well I'm the only one here.\""
msgstr "\"Bueno, soy el único acá.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Who the fuck do you think you're talking to?\""
msgstr "\"¿Con quién mierda te pensás que estás hablando?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What we've got here is failure to communicate.\""
msgstr "\"Lo que tenemos aquí es una falla en la comunicación.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"E.T.  phone home.\""
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm as mad as hell, and I'm not going to take this anymore!\""
msgstr "\"¡Estoy muy enojado y no voy a seguir aguantando esto!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"There's no place like home.\""
msgstr "\"No hay nada mejor que casa.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Badges?  We ain't got no badges!\""
msgstr "\"¿Placas? ¡No tenemos placas!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"We don't need no badges!  I don't have to show you any stinking badges!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡No necesitamos placas! ¡No necesito mostrarte a vos ninguna placa de "
"mierda!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'll be back.\""
msgstr "\"Volveré.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I see dead people.\""
msgstr "\"Veo gente muerta.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's alive!  It's alive!\""
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Say hello to my little friend!\""
msgstr "\"¡Saludá a mi amiguito!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Here's Johnny!\""
msgstr "\"¡Acá está Johnny!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Open the pod bay doors, HAL.\""
msgstr "\"Abre las puertas del receptáculo, HAL.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"They may take our lives, but they'll never take our freedom!\""
msgstr "\"Pueden quitarnos la vida, ¡pero nunca podrán quitarnos la libertad!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"If you let my daughter go now, that'll be the end of it.  I will not look "
"for you, I will not pursue you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si dejás libre a mi hija ahora, esto terminará. No te voy a buscar, no te "
"voy a perseguir.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"If you don't, I will look for you, I will find you, and I will kill you.\""
msgstr "\"Si no, te voy a buscar, te voy a encontrar y te voy a matar.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Roads?  Where we're going, we don't need roads.\""
msgstr "\"¿Caminos? A donde vamos no necesitamos caminos.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Fasten your seatbelts.  It's going to be a bumpy night.\""
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"You've got to ask yourself one question:  'Do I feel lucky?'  Well, do ya "
"punk?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Te tenés que preguntar a vos mismo una cosa: '¿Me siento con suerte?' "
"Bueno, ¿te sentís con suerte, macaco?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You had me at hello.\""
msgstr "\"Ya me convenciste con el hola.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Houston, we have a problem.\""
msgstr "\"Houston, tenemos un problema.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Yippie-ki-yay, motherfucker!\""
msgstr "\"¡Yippie-ki-yay, hijo de puta!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"The first rule of The Lab is:  You do not talk about The Lab.\""
msgstr "\"La primera regla del Laboratorio es: No hablamos del Laboratorio.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't be afraid.  It's just a big, big lap dog.\""
msgstr "\"No tengas miedo. Es solamente un gran, gran perro faldero.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Bring me everyone.\""
msgstr "\"Traigan a todos.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What do you mean everyone?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué quiere decir con 'todos'?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"EVERYONE!\""
msgstr "\"¡TODOS!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm going to make him an offer he can't refuse.\""
msgstr "\"Le voy a hacer una oferta que no va a poder rechazar.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This is the beginning of a beautiful friendship.\""
msgstr "\"Este es el comienzo de una hermosa amistad.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You can’t handle the truth!\""
msgstr "\"¡No podés manejar la verdad!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"If you built it, he will come.\""
msgstr "\"Si vos lo construiste, va a venir.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hasta la vista, baby.\""
msgstr "\"Hasta la vista, baby.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"They’re here!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ya están acá!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Tis but a scratch!\""
msgstr "\"¡Es solo un rasguño!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Frankly, my dear, I don't give a damn.\""
msgstr "\"Francamente, querido, no me importa nada.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.\""
msgstr "\"Mucho trabajo y poca diversión hacen de Jack un tipo aburrido.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Remember: all I'm offering is the truth.  Nothing more.\""
msgstr "\"Recuerda: solo ofrezco la verdad. Nada más.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't call me Shirley.\""
msgstr "\"No me digas Shirley.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I have had it with these motherfucking snakes!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ya estoy podrido de estas malditas serpientes!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Back up, put down the gun, and gimme some tropical flavored bubblicious.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Retrocede, baja el arma, y dame un poco de bubblicious sabor tropical.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"And some skittles.\""
msgstr "\"Y unos Rocklets.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You'll shoot your eye out, kid.\""
msgstr "\"Casi te sacás un ojo, pibe.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Cocainum!\""
msgstr "\"¡Cocainum!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I am your father.\""
msgstr "\"Soy tu padre.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Who said that?\""
msgstr "\"¿Quién dijo eso?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"WHO THE FUCK SAID THAT?!\""
msgstr "\"¡¿QUIÉN CARAJOS DIJO ESO?!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Bullshit!  You didn't convince me!  Show me your real war face!\""
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What is your major malfunction, numbnut?\""
msgstr "\"¿Cuál es tu principal fallo, huevón?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Leeeeeeeeeeeeeroy!  Jenkins rebuild!\""
msgstr "\"¡Leeeeeeeeeeeeeroy! ¡Reconstrucción Jenkins!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Activated!\""
msgstr "\"¡Activado!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Search mode activated!\""
msgstr "\"¡Modo de búsqueda activado!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Coming through!\""
msgstr "\"¡Cuidado que paso!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Deploying!\""
msgstr "\"¡Desplegando!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Critical Error!\""
msgstr "\"¡Error! ¡Crítico!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Ow ow ow!\""
msgstr "\"¡Au au au!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Put me down!\""
msgstr "\"¡Bajame!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Target lost!\""
msgstr "\"¡Perdimos el objetivo!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Searching!\""
msgstr "\"¡Buscando!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey!  It's me!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ey! ¡Soy yo!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Ouch!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ay!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Sentry mode activated.\""
msgstr "\"Modo de guardia activado.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hi.\""
msgstr "\"Hola.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Target acquired.\""
msgstr "\"Objetivo conseguido.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Dispensing product.\""
msgstr "\"Dispensando producto.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Firing.\""
msgstr "\"Disparando.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hello friend.\""
msgstr "\"Hola, amigo.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Gotcha.\""
msgstr "\"Comprendido.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Is anyone there?\""
msgstr "\"¿Hay alguien ahí?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I see you.\""
msgstr "\"Te veo.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Could you come over here?\""
msgstr "\"¿Podés venir para acá?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hellooo.\""
msgstr "\"Hooola.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"My fault.\""
msgstr "\"Error mío.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Ohh.\""
msgstr "\"Ohh.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Critical error.\""
msgstr "\"Error crítico.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Shutting down.\""
msgstr "\"Apagando.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I don't blame you.\""
msgstr "\"No te culpo.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I don't hate you.\""
msgstr "\"No te odio.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Whyyyy.\""
msgstr "\"Por quéééé.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"No hard feelings.\""
msgstr "\"Sin resentimientos.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Aiaiaiaiaiai.\""
msgstr "\"Aiaiaiaiaiai.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"¿Quién sos?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Help.\""
msgstr "\"Ayuda.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Uh oh.\""
msgstr "\"Uh oh.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Illegal operation.\""
msgstr "\"Operación ilegal.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Goodbye.\""
msgstr "\"Adiós.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Sleep mode activated.\""
msgstr "\"Modo de sueño activado.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Your business is appreciated.\""
msgstr "\"Tus negocios son apreciados.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hibernating.\""
msgstr "\"Hibernando.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Goodnight.\""
msgstr "\"Buenas noches.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Resting.\""
msgstr "\"Descansando.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Nap time.\""
msgstr "\"Hora de la siesta.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Are you still there?\""
msgstr "\"¿Todavía estás ahí?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey, it's me!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ey, soy yo!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't shoot!\""
msgstr "\"¡No dispares!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"\""
msgstr "\"\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Stop shooting!\""
msgstr "\"¡Dejá de disparar!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Self test error.\""
msgstr "\"Error de autocomprobación.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Aah.\""
msgstr "\"Aah.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Unknown error.\""
msgstr "\"Error desconocido.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Malfunctioning.\""
msgstr "\"Mal funcionamiento.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Aaaah.\""
msgstr "\"Aaaah.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Ow ow ow ow owww.\""
msgstr "\"Ow ow ow ow owww.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Why?\""
msgstr "\"¿Por qué?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I did everything you asked!\""
msgstr "\"¡Hice todo lo que me pediste!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I don't understand!\""
msgstr "\"¡No entiendo!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm fine!\""
msgstr "\"¡Estoy bien!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Wheeeeee-OH NO!\""
msgstr "\"¡Wheeeeee-OH NO!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm scared!\""
msgstr "\"¡Tengo miedo!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Come closer.\""
msgstr "\"Vení más cerca.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Something's wrong…\""
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What are you doing?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué estás haciendo?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Please stop.\""
msgstr "\"Por favor, pará.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You've made your point.\""
msgstr "\"Ya explicaste tu situación.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Okay, you win.\""
msgstr "\"Ok, ganaste.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This is not good.\""
msgstr "\"Esto no es bueno.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Excuse me?\""
msgstr "\"¿Perdón?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I'm different…\""
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Thanks anyway…\""
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Take me with you…\""
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"You have excellent aim!\""
msgstr "\"¡Tenés una puntería excelente!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I need backup!\""
msgstr "\"¡Necesito ayuda!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I never liked her.\""
msgstr "\"Nunca me cayó bien.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"These things happen.\""
msgstr "\"Estas cosas suceden.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"That was nobody's fault.\""
msgstr "\"No fue culpa de nadie.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"She was provoking you.\""
msgstr "\"Te estaba provocando.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Oh dear.\""
msgstr "\"Válgame diios.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Oh my!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ay, dios!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I blame myself.\""
msgstr "\"Me culpo a mí mismo.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"He probably deserved it.\""
msgstr "\"Probablemente, se lo merecía.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I saw it.  It was an accident.\""
msgstr "\"Yo lo vi. Fue un accidente.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"She's probably okay.\""
msgstr "\"Probablemente, ella esté bien.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Noted.\""
msgstr "\"Anotado.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"But I need to protect the humans!\""
msgstr "\"¡Pero necesito proteger a los humanos!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"We're back!\""
msgstr "\"¡Volvimos!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hi there!\""
msgstr "\"¿Hola, qué tal?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Back again!\""
msgstr "\"¡Otra vez acá!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Well, hello, stranger!\""
msgstr "\"¡Bueno, hola, desconocido!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This time is OUR time.\""
msgstr "\"Este es NUESTRO momento.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Second time's a charm…\""
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Howdy, stranger!\""
msgstr "\"¡Buenas, desconocido!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Thought you'd seen the last of us, didn't ya?\""
msgstr "\"¿Pensaste que no nos ibas a ver más, eh?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Dang!\""
msgstr "\"¡Caramba!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"I thought we fixed that.\""
msgstr "\"Pensé que habíamos solucionado eso.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"What's a guy gotta got to do to get some bullets around here?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué tiene que hacer un muchacho para conseguir unas balas por acá?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Nope.  Still can't see.\""
msgstr "\"Nop. Todavía no puedo ver.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Yep.  Still blind.\""
msgstr "\"Sip. Sigo ciego.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Click click click!  Still defective!\""
msgstr "\"¡Click click click! ¡Sigue sin andar!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Yeah, that's right!  Still defective!\""
msgstr "\"¡Sí, eso es! ¡Sigue sin andar!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Yeah!  Still not working.\""
msgstr "\"¡Sí! Todavía no funciona.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Yeah!  Non-lethal as ever.\""
msgstr "\"¡Sí! No letal como siempre.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Can't.  See.  A.  Thing.\""
msgstr "\"No. Puedo. Ver. Nada.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Absolutely no improvement.\""
msgstr "\"Sin mejora alguna.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Not getting better with age!\""
msgstr "\"¡No se está solucionando con el tiempo!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"This is just getting embarrassing.\""
msgstr "\"Esto ya se está poniendo vergonzoso.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Alright, you can go.\""
msgstr "\"Bueno, podés ir.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"[sigh] Don't tell anyone about this.\""
msgstr "\"[suspiro] No le digas a nadie acerca de esto.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Well, I tried.  Best of luck!\""
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey, safe travels, there.\""
msgstr "\"Ey, que viajes seguro.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey, thanks so much!\""
msgstr "\"Ey, ¡muchas gracias!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Don't be a stranger!\""
msgstr "\"¡Que no se corte!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"It's been a pleasure!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ha sido un placer!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"That was fun, wasn't it?\""
msgstr "\"Estuvo divertido, ¿no?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"I can't see a thing.  What just happened?  Better open fire!  [click click"
" click click]  Dang!\""
msgstr ""
"\"No puedo ver nada. ¿Qué pasó? ¡Mejor disparo!  [click click click click] "
"¡Mierda!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"*clicking noises*\""
msgstr "\"*ruido de chasquidos*\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"No, wait, wait!\""
msgstr "\"¡No, esperá, esperá!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey, hold on now WHOA WHOA WHOA!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ey, esperá un poco WO WO WO!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Oh, this is ridiculous!\""
msgstr "\"¡Oh, esto es ridículo!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Give me another channnnce!\""
msgstr "\"¡Dame otra oportunidaaaaad!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hey!  Squeaky-voice!  Gimme some of your bullets!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ey! ¡Voz de pito! Dame algunas balas!\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Can I get some bullets here?  Anybody got bullets?\""
msgstr "\"¿Me podrían dar unas balas? ¿Alguien tiene balas?\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
msgid "\"Uhhh, no bullets.  Sorry.\""
msgstr "\"Uhhh, sin balas. Lo lamento.\""

#: lang/json/speech_from_json.py
